        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: H. Frank Carey Junior-Senior High School, Sewanhaka Central High School District\n- Places: Franklin Square, New York; Garden City South, New York; Nassau County, New York; West Hempstead; Elmont; United States\n- Concepts: public high schools, hamlets, census-designated places\n\nFacts:\n- Garden City South is a hamlet and census-designated place in Nassau County, New York, United States.\n- H. Frank Carey High School is a public high school located in Franklin Square, New York.\n- H. Frank Carey High School serves students in grades seven through twelve from Franklin Square, Garden City South, West Hempstead, and Elmont.\n- Sewanhaka Central High School District is currently composed of five high schools.\n- Sewanhaka Central High School District includes Sewanhaka High School, Elmont Memorial High School, New Hyde Park Memorial High School, Floral Park Memorial High School, and H. Frank Carey Junior-Senior High School.",
